{"type":"verify_ran","timestamp":"2026-10-01T22:11:52.817Z","data":{"command":"node --import tsx --test tests/report-shared-reads.test.ts","exitCode":0,"duration":0.18,"output":"▶ readSharedFile\n  ✔ reads once and shares one parsed value inside a scope (6.879381ms)\n  ✔ shares one read for calls that start before the first finishes (2.141061ms)\n  ✔ reuses the outer scope for a nested call (2.660921ms)\n  ✔ reads from disk on every call outside a scope (2.13996ms)\n  ✔ shares nothing between two scopes (1.763403ms)\n  ✔ rejects with the file-system error inside and outside a scope (1.877615ms)\n  ✔ does not retry a failed read inside a scope (0.751644ms)\n  ✔ raises no unhandled rejection for a cached failed read (0.768324ms)\n  ✔ rejects when the parser throws, inside and outside a scope (1.685666ms)\n✔ readSharedFile (21.898028ms)\n▶ readTextFile\n  ✔ reads once per path inside a scope and returns the text (1.945752ms)\n  ✔ rejects with the file-system error outside a scope (0.672848ms)\n✔ readTextFile (2.860434ms)\n▶ freezeDeep\n  ✔ freezes the value and every object and array inside it (0.175933ms)\n  ✔ returns a primitive unchanged (0.060692ms)\n  ✔ leaves an already frozen value alone (0.073441ms)\n✔ freezeDeep (0.380848ms)\n▶ readBriefData\n  ✔ returns the brief frontmatter data, frozen (5.394697ms)\n  ✔ returns null for a missing brief (0.661953ms)\n  ✔ reads each brief once per scope for every caller (2.453126ms)\n✔ readBriefData (8.731621ms)\n▶ readManifestObject\n  ✔ returns the manifest parsed as a frozen object (3.939535ms)\n  ✔ returns null for a missing manifest (0.799795ms)\n  ✔ returns null for a malformed manifest (1.670092ms)\n  ✔ returns null when the manifest is not a plain object (1.761393ms)\n  ✔ reads each manifest once per scope for every caller (1.700852ms)\n✔ readManifestObject (10.155762ms)\nℹ tests 22\nℹ suites 5\nℹ pass 22\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 149.527233\n"}}
